{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49974","headline":"句 · 刘禹锡","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"烟波半落新沙地，鸟雀羣飞欲雪天。\n樱桃带雨胭脂湿，杨柳当风绿线低。\n山似屏风江似簟，叩舷来往月明中。\n晴日碧空云脚断，一条如练挂山尖。\n飞文鬬疾敲铜器，陪宴会欢吐锦茵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49974.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49974","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}